#: ../../source/details/density_estimation.ipynb:10004
msgid "Density Estimation"
msgstr "密度估计"

#: ../../source/details/density_estimation.ipynb:10006
msgid ""
"Given the three-dimensional coordinates of a set of particles and their "
"corresponding masses, how can we estimate the mass density at an "
"arbitrary position?"
msgstr ""
"常见的方法包括基于网格剖分的方法，例如 Voronoi 网格剖分和 Delaunay 网格剖分，以及平滑"
"粒子流体力学（SPH）。这些方法在粒子质量分布的形状和范围上各不相同。"

#: ../../source/details/density_estimation.ipynb:10008
msgid ""
"Common approaches include tessellation-based methods, such as Voronoi and"
" Delaunay tessellations, as well as Smoothed Particle Hydrodynamics "
"(SPH). These methods differ in how particle mass is distributed in shape "
"and extent."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/details/density_estimation.ipynb:10010
msgid ""
"Among them, SPH provides a good balance between computational efficiency "
"and accuracy, so `Gal3D` adopts the SPH approach, which can also be "
"viewed as an adaptive kernel density estimation (adaptive KDE) method. "
"SPH distributes the mass of point particles into a continuous mass-"
"density field through a kernel function."
msgstr ""
"其中，SPH 在计算效率和精度之间提供了较好的平衡，因此 `Gal3D` 采用了 SPH 方"
"法；它也可以被看作一种自适应核密度估计（adaptive KDE）方法。SPH 通过核函数"
"将点粒子的质量分配到连续的质量密度场中。"

#: ../../source/details/density_estimation.ipynb:10012
msgid "SPH Density Estimation"
msgstr "SPH 密度估计"

#: ../../source/details/density_estimation.ipynb:10014
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"By default, `Gal3D` uses the cubic spline kernel, $W(\\mathbf{r}, h) = "
"w\\left(\\dfrac{r}{h}\\right)$, whose explicit form is"
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，`Gal3D` 使用三次样条核函数，$W(\\mathbf{r}, h) = "
"w\\left(\\dfrac{r}{h}\\right)$，其显式形式为"

#: ../../source/details/density_estimation.ipynb:10016
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"    w(u) = \\frac{8}{\\pi} \\begin{cases}\n"
"        1 - 6 u^{2} + 6 u^{3}, & 0 \\le u \\le \\tfrac{1}{2},\\\\[6pt]\n"
"        2 (1 - u)^{3}, & \\tfrac{1}{2} < u \\le 1,\\\\[6pt]\n"
"        0, & \\text{otherwise.}\n"
"    \\end{cases}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/details/density_estimation.ipynb:10024
#: ../../source/details/density_estimation.ipynb:20021
msgid "and it satisfies the normalization condition"
msgstr "并满足归一化条件"

#: ../../source/details/density_estimation.ipynb:10026
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"    4 \\pi \\int_{0}^{\\infty} w(u) u^{2} \\mathrm{d}u = 1.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/details/density_estimation.ipynb:10030
msgid ""
"Here, $h$ is a key parameter in SPH that determines the spatial extent of"
" a particle's influence. If $h$ is too large, the density field becomes "
"overly smooth and fails to capture fine structures between particles. If "
"$h$ is too small, the density field may become noisy. Therefore, choosing"
" an appropriate value of $h$ is essential for good SPH performance."
msgstr ""
"这里，$h$ 是 SPH 中的一个关键参数，用于决定粒子影响范围的空间尺度。若 $h$ "
"过大，密度场会过于平滑，从而无法刻画粒子之间的精细结构；若 $h$ 过小，密度场"
"则可能变得噪声较大。因此，选择合适的 $h$ 值对于获得良好的 SPH 效果至关重要。"

#: ../../source/details/density_estimation.ipynb:10032
msgid ""
"In `Gal3D`, the value of $h$ for each particle is defined as the distance"
" to its $k$-th nearest neighbor. This allows $h$ to adapt automatically "
"to the local density environment, improving the stability of the density "
"estimate."
msgstr ""
"在 `Gal3D` 中，每个粒子的 $h$ 被定义为其到第 $k$ 个最近邻粒子的距离。这使得"
"$h$ 能够根据局部密度环境自动调整，从而提高密度估计的稳定性。"

#: ../../source/details/density_estimation.ipynb:10034
msgid ""
"To perform nearest-neighbor searches, `Gal3D` uses "
"[scipy.spatial.KDTree](https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/generated/scipy.spatial.KDTree.html#scipy.spatial.KDTree)."
" By default, `Gal3D` sets `k=32` to define the particle neighborhood and "
"determine $h$."
msgstr ""
"为了执行最近邻搜索，`Gal3D` 使用 "
"[scipy.spatial.KDTree](https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/generated/scipy.spatial.KDTree.html#scipy.spatial.KDTree)。"
"默认情况下，`Gal3D` 设置 `k=32` 来定义粒子的邻域并确定 $h$。"

#: ../../source/details/density_estimation.ipynb:10036
msgid ""
"For the density $\\rho_i$ at an arbitrary position, the estimate is "
"computed from the $k$ nearest particles as"
msgstr ""
"对于任意位置处的密度 $\\rho_i$，其估计值由最近的 $k$ 个粒子计算得到："

#: ../../source/details/density_estimation.ipynb:10038
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"    \\rho_i = \\sum_{j=1}^{k} m_j W(\\mathbf{r}_i - \\mathbf{r}_j, h_i)\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/details/density_estimation.ipynb:20004
msgid "SPH Projection"
msgstr "SPH 投影"

#: ../../source/details/density_estimation.ipynb:20006
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"In `Gal3D`, SPH projection uses the projected form of the cubic spline "
"kernel, $\\Sigma\\left(\\dfrac{R}{h}\\right)$, given by"
msgstr ""
"在 `Gal3D` 中，SPH 投影使用三次样条核函数的投影形式 "
"$\\Sigma\\left(\\dfrac{R}{h}\\right)$，其表达式为"

#: ../../source/details/density_estimation.ipynb:20008
msgid ""
"\n"
"    \\Sigma(q) = \\dfrac{2}{\\pi}\n"
"    \\begin{cases}\n"
"        (4 + 26q^2)\\sqrt{1-q^2} - (1 + 26q^2)\\sqrt{1-4q^2} \\\\\n"
"        \\qquad - 18q^4 \\ln\\left(\\dfrac{2q}{1+\\sqrt{1-4q^2}}\\right)\n"
"        - "
"6q^2(4+q^2)\\ln\\left(\\dfrac{2+2\\sqrt{1-q^2}}{1+\\sqrt{1-4q^2}}\\right)"
"\n"
"        & 0 \\leq q \\leq \\tfrac{1}{2}, \\\\[12pt]\n"
"        2(2 + 13q^2)\\sqrt{1-q^2} + "
"6q^2(4+q^2)\\ln\\left(\\dfrac{q}{1+\\sqrt{1-q^2}}\\right)\n"
"        & \\tfrac{1}{2} < q \\leq 1, \\\\[12pt]\n"
"        0 & \\text{otherwise.}\n"
"    \\end{cases}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/details/density_estimation.ipynb:20023
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"    2 \\pi \\int_{0}^{\\infty} \\Sigma(q) q \\mathrm{d}q = 1.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/details/density_estimation.ipynb:20027
msgid ""
"For a given two-dimensional grid, particle mass is distributed onto the "
"grid using the projected kernel. When the particle size is $\\lesssim$ "
"the grid size, `Gal3D` uses [particle "
"subsampling](https://arxiv.org/abs/2106.05281) to reduce numerical "
"errors. In addition, to preserve mass conservation in the projection, the"
" contribution from each particle is renormalized."
msgstr ""
"对于给定的二维网格，粒子质量通过投影核函数分配到网格上。当粒子尺寸 "
"$\\lesssim$ 网格尺寸时，`Gal3D` 使用 [particle "
"subsampling](https://arxiv.org/abs/2106.05281) 来减小数值误差。此外，为了"
"在投影中保持质量守恒，每个粒子的贡献都会被重新归一化。"

#: ../../source/details/density_estimation.ipynb:20029
msgid ""
"The figure below shows an example of how the mass of a single particle, "
"indicated by the red point and its corresponding red circle, is "
"distributed on a grid, and how the subsampling method improves the "
"accuracy."
msgstr ""
"下图展示了一个示例：单个粒子的质量如何分配到网格上，其中红点及其对应的红色圆"
"表示该粒子，同时也展示了 subsampling 方法如何提高精度。"

#: ../../source/details/density_estimation.ipynb:40002
msgid "Example"
msgstr "示例"

#: ../../source/details/density_estimation.ipynb:40004
msgid ""
"Below is a simple example in which 10,000 particles are generated with "
"random three-dimensional coordinates and random masses, and the total "
"mass is normalized to $10^8$:"
msgstr ""
"下面给出一个简单示例：生成 10,000 个具有随机三维坐标和随机质量的粒子，并将总"
"质量归一化为 $10^8$："

#: ../../source/details/density_estimation.ipynb:60002
msgid ""
"Next, we illustrate how the number of neighbors $k$ and the projection "
"grid resolution `nbins` affect the projected particle distribution. From "
"left to right, the panels show increasing $k$ values (4, 16, 32, 64, "
"128), and from top to bottom they show increasing `nbins` values (8, 32, "
"128, 512, 1024)."
msgstr ""
"接下来，我们展示最近邻数 $k$ 和投影网格分辨率 `nbins` 如何影响粒子的投影分"
"布。从左到右，各面板对应逐渐增大的 $k$ 值（4、16、32、64、128）；从上到下，"
"对应逐渐增大的 `nbins` 值（8、32、128、512、1024）。"

#: ../../source/details/density_estimation.ipynb:60004
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"As $k$ increases, the corresponding value of $h$ also becomes larger, so "
"each particle influences a broader spatial region and the projected "
"result becomes smoother. In addition, the difference between the "
"projected total mass and the true total mass is nearly negligible, with "
"$\\Delta M / M_{tot} \\lesssim 10^{-5}$."
msgstr ""
"随着 $k$ 的增大，对应的 $h$ 值也会变大，因此每个粒子会影响更广的空间区域，"
"投影结果也会更加平滑。此外，投影后的总质量与真实总质量之间的差异几乎可以忽"
"略，满足 $\\Delta M / M_{tot} \\lesssim 10^{-5}$。"

